@host = http://localhost:5088
@adminToken = REEMPLAZAR_POR_TOKEN_ADMIN
@studentToken = REEMPLAZAR_POR_TOKEN_STUDENT
@roleId = 4
@subjectId = 1
@professorId = 1
@studentId = 6

### Roles: solo administradores
GET {{host}}/api/Role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Crear un rol adicional
POST {{host}}/api/Role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Consulta",
  "description": "Usuario con acceso a consultas generales"
}

### Actualizar descripción del rol
PUT {{host}}/api/Role/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Consulta",
  "description": "Acceso a consultas generales del programa"
}

### Desactivar: se rechazan roles del sistema o asignados a usuarios
DELETE {{host}}/api/Role/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reactivar
PATCH {{host}}/api/Role/{{roleId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Catálogo paginado de materias activas
GET {{host}}/api/Subject?PageNumber=1&PageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Detalle de materia
GET {{host}}/api/Subject/{{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Crear materia: máximo 2 materias activas por profesor; professorId admite null
POST {{host}}/api/Subject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nueva materia",
  "description": "Descripción de la materia",
  "credits": 3,
  "professorId": {{professorId}}
}

### Actualizar: el profesor debe ser un User activo con rol Professor
PUT {{host}}/api/Subject/{{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Matemáticas",
  "description": "Fundamentos de matemáticas",
  "credits": 3,
  "professorId": {{professorId}}
}

### Desactivar: no debe tener inscripciones
DELETE {{host}}/api/Subject/{{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reactivar: vuelve a validar el profesor asignado y su capacidad
PATCH {{host}}/api/Subject/{{subjectId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Mis materias y total de créditos
GET {{host}}/api/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Reemplazar mi selección completa; [] permite retirar todas las materias
PUT {{host}}/api/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectIds": [1, 3, 5] }

### Retirar una materia
DELETE {{host}}/api/enrollments/me/{{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Compañeros: solo nombres y solo si estoy inscrito en esa materia
GET {{host}}/api/enrollments/me/{{subjectId}}/classmates?PageNumber=1&PageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Registros de estudiantes: nombres y materias, sin datos privados
GET {{host}}/api/students?PageNumber=1&PageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Administración de inscripciones de un estudiante
GET {{host}}/api/enrollments/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reemplazar la selección del estudiante: PUT /api/enrollments/{studentId}
### Para retirar una materia: DELETE /api/enrollments/{studentId}/{subjectId}
PUT {{host}}/api/enrollments/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectIds": [1, 3, 5] }
